{"seq":8,"slug":"cpp-fundamentals","title":"C/C++ 基础","stage":"DONE","category":"languages","chapterCount":6,"docCount":20,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/cpp-fundamentals","rating":{"composite":3.8,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.4,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":5,"strategic":2.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.06,"verdict":"skip-for-this-profile","uScore":1.5}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"c-c-基础-简介\">C/C++ 基础 简介</h1><p>本 hub 聚焦 <strong>C++ 这门语言本身</strong>：类型系统、内存管理、现代 C++（C++11/17/20）特性、模板泛型、STL 容器与系统编程实践。目标是让有其他语言经验的工程师真正掌握「为什么 C++ 这样设计」——值语义、零开销抽象、手动内存控制与编译期计算，而不只是抄惯用法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-vs-兄弟-hub-的分工边界\">本 hub vs 兄弟 hub 的分工边界</h2><p>C/C++ 横跨多个相邻主题，容易与其他 hub 重叠。下表明确「什么在这里学、什么去别处学」：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>你想学的</th>\n<th>来这个 hub</th>\n<th>而不是</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>C++ 语言特性、STL、模板、移动语义、RAII</td>\n<td><strong>本 hub</strong></td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>这是 C++ 的语言核心</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>纯 C 的指针、结构体、UB、系统调用、C23</td>\n<td><a href=\"../c-language-programming/\">C 语言编程</a></td>\n<td>本 hub</td>\n<td>C++ 在 C 之上做了大量抽象，C 的底层细节在那里更系统</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>并发模型理论（actor、CSP、STM、数据并行）</td>\n<td><a href=\"../concurrency-models/\">并发模型</a></td>\n<td>本 hub 的「并发编程」</td>\n<td>本 hub 只讲 C++ 的 thread/atomic/锁的<strong>用法</strong>，模型谱系在那里</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>类型论、泛型/多态的语言无关原理</td>\n<td><a href=\"../type-systems/\">类型系统</a></td>\n<td>本 hub 的模板章</td>\n<td>本 hub 讲模板的<strong>机制与写法</strong>，「类型为何如此」在那里</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>编译期元编程的通论（宏、反射、代码生成）</td>\n<td><a href=\"../metaprogramming/\">元编程</a></td>\n<td>本 hub 的模板章</td>\n<td>模板是元编程的一个实例，元编程全景在那里</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内存安全的另一条路线（所有权+借用检查）</td>\n<td><a href=\"../rust-language/\">Rust 语言</a></td>\n<td>本 hub</td>\n<td>Rust 用编译器静态消除本 hub 靠纪律+工具防的错误，值得对照</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>栈帧、调用约定、SIMD 的汇编层视角</td>\n<td><a href=\"../assembly-language/\">汇编语言</a></td>\n<td>本 hub 的内存章</td>\n<td>本 hub 到「栈帧概念」为止，指令级细节在那里</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>简言之：<strong>本 hub = C++ 语言与标准库</strong>；底层 C 细节、并发/类型/元编程的通论、以及 Rust 这条对照路线，都在各自的兄弟 hub。各 L4 叶子末尾的「延伸阅读与跨学科链接」给出了具体的跳转点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>必备</strong>：至少一门编程语言的实战经验、基本数据结构（数组/链表/树/哈希表）、函数与作用域概念。</li>\n<li><strong>强烈建议</strong>：先过一遍 <a href=\"../c-language-programming/c-fundamentals/memory-model-and-layout\">C 语言·内存模型与布局</a> 与 <a href=\"../c-language-programming/pointers-and-data-structures/pointers-and-arrays\">C 语言·指针与数组</a>——C++ 的指针、栈/堆、对齐都建立在 C 的模型上，补齐后学习曲线会平缓很多。</li>\n<li><strong>可选</strong>：了解 CPU 缓存行、虚拟内存的大致概念，有助于理解内存对齐、缓存友好性与 false sharing。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径\">推荐学习路径</h2><p>本 hub 共 6 章 20 篇，按依赖关系而非章节编号组织最优。按人群分流：</p>\n<p><strong>路径 A — 从其他高级语言转入（Java/Python/JS/Go 背景）</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li><a href=\"cpp-core-language/types-variables\">类型系统与变量</a> → <a href=\"cpp-core-language/pointers-references\">指针与引用</a>：先建立值语义与值类别的直觉，这是后续一切的地基。</li>\n<li><a href=\"memory-management/stack-heap\">栈与堆内存</a> → <a href=\"memory-management/raii-smart-pointers\">RAII 与智能指针</a> → <a href=\"memory-management/memory-pitfalls\">内存陷阱与调试</a>：内存管理是 C++ 最关键也最易错的难点，务必吃透。</li>\n<li><a href=\"memory-management/move-semantics\">移动语义与完美转发</a>：理解 C++11 最重要的性能特性。</li>\n<li><a href=\"stl-containers/sequence-containers\">序列容器</a> → <a href=\"stl-containers/associative-containers\">关联容器</a> → <a href=\"stl-containers/iterators-algorithms\">迭代器与算法</a>：日常编码主力工具。</li>\n<li><a href=\"cpp-core-language/oop-fundamentals\">面向对象基础</a> → 模板三篇 → <a href=\"cpp-modern/cpp17-cpp20\">C++17/C++20 新特性</a>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>路径 B — 有 C 基础，想升级到现代 C++</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>快速浏览第一、二章（你已熟悉指针/内存），重点看 <a href=\"memory-management/raii-smart-pointers\">RAII 与智能指针</a> 与 <a href=\"cpp-core-language/oop-fundamentals\">面向对象基础</a> 的 Rule of Five/Zero。</li>\n<li>直奔现代 C++：<a href=\"cpp-modern/move-semantics\">移动语义与右值引用</a> → <a href=\"cpp-modern/templates-generic\">模板与泛型编程</a> → <a href=\"cpp-modern/cpp17-cpp20\">C++17/C++20 新特性</a>。</li>\n<li>模板专章：<a href=\"templates-generics/function-templates\">函数模板</a> → <a href=\"templates-generics/class-templates\">类模板与特化</a> → <a href=\"templates-generics/concepts-constraints\">Concepts 与约束</a>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>路径 C — 系统/性能工程方向</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>在路径 A 基础上，重点攻 <a href=\"cpp-systems/concurrency\">C++ 并发编程</a>、<a href=\"cpp-systems/io-networking\">IO 与网络编程</a>、<a href=\"cpp-systems/build-systems\">C++ 构建系统</a>，并把内存章的对齐/缓存行/内存池吃透。</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p>注：第二章「内存管理」与第三章「现代 C++」在移动语义、智能指针上有意做了<strong>互补的重复覆盖</strong>——内存章侧重资源管理视角，现代 C++ 章侧重语言特性视角，可对照阅读。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"cpp-core-language","title":"核心语言特性","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/cpp-fundamentals/cpp-core-language","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"types-variables","title":"类型系统与变量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/cpp-fundamentals/cpp-core-language/types-variables"},{"seq":2,"slug":"pointers-references","title":"指针与引用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/cpp-fundamentals/cpp-core-language/pointers-references"},{"seq":3,"slug":"oop-fundamentals","title":"面向对象基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/cpp-fundamentals/cpp-core-language/oop-fundamentals"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"memory-management","title":"内存管理","docCount":5,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/cpp-fundamentals/memory-management","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"stack-heap","title":"栈与堆内存","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/cpp-fundamentals/memory-management/stack-heap"},{"seq":2,"slug":"raii-smart-pointers","title":"RAII 与智能指针","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/cpp-fundamentals/memory-management/raii-smart-pointers"},{"seq":3,"slug":"memory-pitfalls","title":"内存陷阱与调试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/cpp-fundamentals/memory-management/memory-pitfalls"},{"seq":4,"slug":"smart-pointers","title":"智能指针与 RAII","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/cpp-fundamentals/memory-management/smart-pointers"},{"seq":5,"slug":"move-semantics","title":"移动语义与完美转发","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/cpp-fundamentals/memory-management/move-semantics"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"cpp-modern","titl